        "edit": "Changed the counter wrap comparison from 'if(tmp<=1000000)' to 'if(tmp<1000000)' so the 21-bit tmp register does not increment past 1000000 (which would overflow the 7-digit decimal display range and cause the Q outputs to diverge from the expected oracle at the first observed cycle).",
